  NC14 (all three identical at length 1): ok
  NC15 (deferred differs from per_step somewhere, so the probe has resolution): ok

  The carried form reproduces the deferred answer on every chain up to length 3,
  and stops reproducing it above that. F extra bits of state buy exactly F extra
  fraction bits, and a product of k factors needs F*(k-1) of them.
